# Append-only files merge by union: two machines writing the same day both survive.
# Do NOT extend this to LEDGER.md — its rows are edited in place, and union on an
# edited row keeps both versions of it, silently.
LEDGER-LOG.md merge=union
ANSWERS.md merge=union

# Hunk headers name the nearest heading.
*.md diff=markdown

# One line-ending convention, decided here rather than per machine.
* text=auto eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
